# pnpm refuses to expand environment variables in a committed registry URL,
# so the in-network registry is written literally (as nectar-eligibility
# does). Off-network builds pass ARDC_NPM_REGISTRY to `make build`, which
# rewrites this file inside the image; developers off-network edit the URL
# locally and keep the change out of their commits.
@ardc-ui:registry=https://verdaccio.artm.rc.nectar.org.au/
